  "description": "HIPAA-aware logging bridge for FHIR / healthcare interoperability apps: connects IApplicationLogger (HealthData.Interop.Abstractions) to Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.ILogger via IApplicationLoggerBridge and the ToIApplicationLogger() extension. Works with NLog, Serilog, or any ILogger provider, with automatic PHI masking. Part of the HealthData.Interop FHIR toolkit — most users should install HealthData.Interop.Fhir. Provided as-is; does not by itself ensure HIPAA compliance.",
